THREAD INTERFERENCE
    When the execution of one thread interrupted by the another thread
    is called thread interference.
    It can lead to data inconsistency.

    Non atomic operation
    Shared resources
    Race condition
    Order / Visibility

Problems for Data inconsistency can be solved using
    1.Synchronised block/method
    2.volatile keyword -> so that thread read value directly from the MEMORY
    3.Atmoic integer
    4.Proper locking mechanism.
